<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">The checkout redesign can be hidden with a flag, but its new order format is already in storage. Separate the part you can switch back from the data that older clients still have to read.</p>

<!-- @before Staff Engineer Thinking :: staff -->
### Rehearse the rollback after the write

Describe the rollback from the moment the first new record has been written. Identify the oldest reader it must support and how the app behaves with cached settings. Choose a compatible change or a recovery path before enabling the feature. [Firebase activation strategies](https://firebase.google.com/docs/remote-config/loading).
